00:18:10,088 --> 00:18:12,918
I gelatinized it to give it a sauce-like consistency.

525
00:18:13,518 --> 00:18:15,657
That's green onion on the side.

526
00:18:15,658 --> 00:18:18,428
You can sprinkle it on like salt.

527
00:18:18,728 --> 00:18:19,797
Please try it.

528
00:18:19,798 --> 00:18:22,498
(Pork belly katsu made with Changnyeong white pork)

529
00:18:23,398 --> 00:18:28,508
(Taking a big bite)

530
00:18:31,508 --> 00:18:32,778
You have to try it with green onions.

531
00:18:34,348 --> 00:18:35,448
(Topped with green onions)

532
00:18:36,008 --> 00:18:37,048
(Crunch)

533
00:18:39,278 --> 00:18:40,348
I forgot to investigate.

534
00:18:40,748 --> 00:18:43,687
Doesn't the fried coating taste subtly different from last one?

535
00:18:43,688 --> 00:18:44,888
- Yes. - Yes.

536
00:18:45,488 --> 00:18:48,528
Gosh, it tastes really good.

537
00:18:51,228 --> 00:18:52,228
(Crunch)

538
00:18:54,598 --> 00:18:56,728
Sun Kyu and Jin Young are really enjoying it.

539
00:18:57,498 --> 00:18:59,437
Since each piece comes out one at a time,

540
00:18:59,438 --> 00:19:01,638
- I try to savour every bite. - Right.

541
00:19:01,838 --> 00:19:03,068
That's why it tastes even better.

542
00:19:03,738 --> 00:19:05,908
I bet you'll make a reservation before you go.

543
00:19:06,238 --> 00:19:08,007
Are you fully booked?

544
00:19:08,008 --> 00:19:09,207
(Being serious)

545
00:19:09,208 --> 00:19:11,447
Yes, we're fully booked right now.

546
00:19:11,448 --> 00:19:13,117
Coincidentally, he says that he's fully booked.

547
00:19:13,118 --> 00:19:14,118
- Right. - My gosh.

548
00:19:14,119 --> 00:19:16,588
But we're not on a food tour.

549
00:19:19,058 --> 00:19:20,757
We have to figure out if it's real or fake.

550
00:19:20,758 --> 00:19:21,758
(You should be suspicious.)

551
00:19:21,759 --> 00:19:23,527
- The food is real. - The food is real.

552
00:19:23,528 --> 00:19:24,528
The food is definitely real.

553
00:19:24,529 --> 00:19:25,697
It tastes really good.

554
00:19:25,698 --> 00:19:26,698
(There's no denying how good it is.)

555
00:19:26,698 --> 00:19:27,698
It's so delicious.

556
00:19:27,699 --> 00:19:30,527
The problem with good food is that it makes you stop investigating.

557
00:19:30,528 --> 00:19:32,767
It's the same for me. I only focus on the food.

558
00:19:32,768 --> 00:19:33,798
(We still have to investigate.)

559
00:19:34,468 --> 00:19:37,638
Could there be something like this among CJ’s frozen food products?

560
00:19:38,078 --> 00:19:39,407
(Could this be frozen food?)

561
00:19:39,408 --> 00:19:40,408
Gourmet.

562
00:19:40,409 --> 00:19:42,878
Exactly. We need to take a closer look.

563
00:19:43,308 --> 00:19:44,877
There are so many products out there.

564
00:19:44,878 --> 00:19:45,878
(He's starting to get suspicious.)

565
00:19:45,879 --> 00:19:47,317
We don't get to see the frying process,

566
00:19:47,318 --> 00:19:49,387
- Right. - so it may be a ready-made product.

567
00:19:49,388 --> 00:19:50,747
(Could this be a frozen product?)

568
00:19:50,748 --> 00:19:53,488
When did you fry the meat?

569
00:19:54,158 --> 00:19:56,058
I fried it before you arrived.

570
00:19:58,698 --> 00:19:59,828
Are you sure about that?

571
00:20:00,428 --> 00:20:01,627
(He lets his guard down immediately.)

572
00:20:01,628 --> 00:20:03,328
I'm sorry, sir.

573
00:20:03,998 --> 00:20:06,097
(Bursting out laughing)

574
00:20:06,098 --> 00:20:09,567
We should be suspicious.

575
00:20:09,568 --> 00:20:10,568
(You're doing well, Jin Young.)

576
00:20:12,178 --> 00:20:13,337
Thank you, sir.

577
00:20:13,338 --> 00:20:14,448
