771
00:27:34,688 --> 00:27:36,347
- This isn't the place. - I see.

772
00:27:36,348 --> 00:27:37,917
That's not it. It's this way.

773
00:27:37,918 --> 00:27:39,218
(Sixth Sense members head towards the sign.)

774
00:27:40,588 --> 00:27:41,658
This place is...

775
00:27:44,528 --> 00:27:46,328
It has a very nice atmosphere.

776
00:27:47,058 --> 00:27:49,067
(Entering a road of bamboo)

777
00:27:49,068 --> 00:27:50,228
This place looks real.

778
00:27:50,368 --> 00:27:52,938
It feels like entering a secret door.

779
00:27:53,468 --> 00:27:54,537
It's beautiful.

780
00:27:54,538 --> 00:27:55,738
(Everyone enters a secret space.)

781
00:27:55,968 --> 00:27:57,238
It looks real.

782
00:27:59,008 --> 00:28:00,377
(Exclaiming)

783
00:28:00,378 --> 00:28:01,478
What's this?

784
00:28:02,048 --> 00:28:03,177
What's this?

785
00:28:03,178 --> 00:28:04,678
(Wide-eyed with surprise)

786
00:28:06,518 --> 00:28:08,088
- This is... - It's nice.

787
